  "prefLabel": "Fis 1004.02 Calculation of Time",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Fis 1004.02 Calculation of Time. Any deadline or time period established in these rules shall be computed in accordance with RSA 21:35, provided that a deadline or time period established by statute shall be extended only if the statute expressly provides for such an extension.\n\nSource. #13313, eff 2-3-22",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/fis1000.html"
